    comment "en" """
        Source X4551 = Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension of X45 SNOMED CT 216633005 (Athena ICD10
        concept 45756401), refined by Swedish external-cause metadata: place=butiks-, handels- eller
        serviceområde (shop, trade or service area); activity=lek och annan fritidsverksamhet (play and
        other leisure activity). The clinical event/exposure is unchanged; the Swedish place/activity
        qualifiers are external-cause metadata with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical analogue.
        Target SNOMED CT 441465 = sctid 216633005. Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps base X45
        (concept_id 45756401) -> 441465 (relationship 45756401, 441465); it is the authoritative
        standard concept for X45 and fully subsumes every place/activity-specific SE subdivision.
        mapping_type=broader (target fully contains every clinical meaning of the source; the dropped
        qualifier is breadth-neutral external-cause metadata, not a partial slice). Confidence (high):
        verified Athena crosswalk on the base code with a small, well-understood one-level breadth
        mismatch (the SE place/activity refinement is lost). Athena-local research only.
        """
}
